  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往法兰城里谢里雅堡2楼谒见之间与王妃（8.4）对话，选“是”获得【国王的推荐函】。",
      "type": "step",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "2.前往哥拉尔镇白之宫殿2楼谒见之间与艾尔菲娜斯女王（58.46）对话，交出【国王的推荐函】获得【烛台】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "3.出哥拉尔镇北门，往东北方向行走至（376.303）处与士兵托鲁克对话，选“是”解散队伍并传送至阴森的入口。",
      "type": "teleport-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "4.通过楼梯（10.7）进入阴森的洞窟。在迷宫内寻找随机出现的士兵迪恩并与之对话，获得【门的钥匙】。",
      "type": "maze-objective",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "◆阴森的洞窟为随机迷宫，约23层",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "魔物为Lv.60~81风龙蜥、雏龙、地狱骷髅、小恶魔",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "◆【门的钥匙】每名队友都需要持有",
      "type": "party-item-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "5.通过随机迷宫抵达谜样的房间与露比（13.5）对话，交出【烛台】、【门的钥匙】解散队伍并切换地图。",
      "type": "combined-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "6.通过（7.5）处的楼梯进入漆黑的房间，寻找迷宫内随机出现的箱子并进行调查，获得【门的钥匙】。",
      "type": "maze-objective",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "◆漆黑的房间为随机迷宫，地图较大；迷宫内会有多个箱子出现，需寻找正确的箱子",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "◆【门的钥匙】每名队友都需要持有",
      "type": "party-item-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "7.返回谜样的房间，调查（13.4）处的门，选“是”解散队伍并传送至秘密的房间。",
      "type": "door-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "8.与露比（13.6）对话，进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "◆BOSS：Lv.85露比，血量约16000，技能：攻击、防御、强力补血魔法Lv.7、强力恢复魔法Lv.7、超强遗忘魔法Lv.10、超强混乱魔法Lv.10、强力风刃魔法Lv.10、强力冰冻魔法Lv.10、强力陨石魔法Lv.10、强力火焰魔法Lv.10",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "◆喽啰：Lv.80大地鼠*4、恶梦鼠*4，血量约500",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "9.战斗胜利后队伍中随机1名队员获得【宝石？】。与露比对话，交出【门的钥匙】获得【士兵的头盔】并传送至库鲁克斯岛（375.303）处。",
      "type": "reward-and-exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "◆【宝石？】鉴定后为Lv.8紫宝石",
      "type": "identified-item-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "10.返回哥拉尔镇白之宫殿2楼谒见之间与艾尔菲娜斯女王对话，交出【士兵的头盔】获得【女皇的感谢信】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "11.返回法兰城，前往里谢利雅堡2楼谒见之间与王妃对话，交出【女皇的感谢信】获得【蓝月之戒】或【猩红之戒】，任务完结。",
      "type": "completion-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "◆【蓝月之戒】：Lv.4戒指、耐久150；敏捷+18、精神+15、回复+9、反击+5、闪躲+5、魔力+25；装备后获得称号“不竭的思想”；数值浮动；不可交易、丢地消失；",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "◆【猩红之戒】：Lv.4戒指、耐久150；攻击+25、防御+17、敏捷+17、必杀+5、命中+5、生命+25；装备后获得称号“无穷的力量”；数值浮动；不可交易、丢地消失；",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "◆持有【蓝月之戒】或【猩红之戒】时，不可重接本任务",
      "type": "repeat-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    }
  ],
